And thanks, Tom, for setting
the bar so high for animations

00:23:49.590 --> 00:23:52.710
and slides that none of
us will ever measure up.

00:23:52.710 --> 00:23:54.810
All right, so Tom
mentioned earlier

00:23:54.810 --> 00:23:56.730
that Spinnaker enables
his development teams

00:23:56.730 --> 00:23:59.220
to push changes into
production with confidence.

00:23:59.220 --> 00:24:01.387
And I gather he has
some kind of confidence,

00:24:01.387 --> 00:24:02.970
because he's going
to allow me to push

00:24:02.970 --> 00:24:06.540
a change live into the
