00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:10.550
So if I could have the
demo laptop, please.

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:12.020
All right, so we'll
kick this off.

00:24:12.020 --> 00:24:13.160
We'll let it run
in the background,

00:24:13.160 --> 00:24:14.534
and then we'll
